      "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Placebo-Controlled, Dose Escalation Study to Evaluate the Safety and Efficacy of Tildacerfont in Adult Subjects With Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) and Elevated Adrenal Androgens"
